<title>INDIA: India - Forward dollar rates-(opening)-May 29.</title>
<headline>India - Forward dollar rates-(opening)-May 29.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bombay banks quoted the forward premia on dollar at the following rates (in paise):</p>
<p>	     Cash Spot	Cash Tom	 Tom Spot</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>  TIME	Bid/Ask	  Bid/Ask	 Bid/Ask</p>
<p>(in IST)</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>(May 29)</p>
<p>1030	 0075/0125	0000/0025     0075/0100</p>
<p>(May 28 close)</p>
<p>1600	 0000/0000	0000/0000     0000/0000</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>	  Jun    Jul    Aug   Sept    Oct    Nov    Dec</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
